{"event_id":"EV_mv1q945u_ehwrgefh","cycle_id":"_architect-2026-10-10T00-31-50-43ce1241","started_at":"2026-10-10T01:40:24.018Z","initiative_id":"INIT-2026-10-10-i1-honest-baseline","parent_event_id":"EV_mv1q68ol_k2qslhr0","phase":"architect","skill":"architect-completeness-critic","event_type":"log","input_refs":["/home/parso/forge/_logs/_sessions/gitweave/_architect/2026-10-10T00-31-50-43ce1241/PLAN.md"],"output_refs":[],"message":"architect.completeness-critic.finding (medium): The ci.yaml pytest command currently carries --deselect for test_bootstrap_script_exits_zero (stated in the Brain-sourced constraints). Step 5 says the test 'must pass without the --deselect flag' after bootstrap.sh is fixed, but no step instructs updating ci.yaml to remove that flag. Step 6 handles other ci.yaml edits (smoke assertion) without mentioning the --deselect removal. An implementer following the steps in order will fix bootstrap.sh in Step 5 and update the smoke assertion in Step 6 without a prompt to also drop --deselect, leaving the test perpetually skipped rather than green.","metadata":{"session_id":"2026-10-10T00-31-50-43ce1241","severity":"medium","initiativeId":"INIT-2026-10-10-i1-honest-baseline","gap":"The ci.yaml pytest command currently carries --deselect for test_bootstrap_script_exits_zero (stated in the Brain-sourced constraints). Step 5 says the test 'must pass without the --deselect flag' after bootstrap.sh is fixed, but no step instructs updating ci.yaml to remove that flag. Step 6 handles other ci.yaml edits (smoke assertion) without mentioning the --deselect removal. An implementer following the steps in order will fix bootstrap.sh in Step 5 and update the smoke assertion in Step 6 without a prompt to also drop --deselect, leaving the test perpetually skipped rather than green."}}
